{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20338","headline":"南归 · 张籍","name":"南归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"促促念道路，四支不常宁。\n行车未及家，天外非尽程。\n骨肉待我欢，乡里望我荣。\n岂知东与西，顦顇竟无成。\n人言苦夜长，穷者不念明。\n惧离其寝寐，百忧伤性灵。\n世道多险薄，相劝毕中诚。\n远游无知音，不如商贾行。\n达人有常志，愚夫劳所营。\n旧山行去远，言归乐此生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20338.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20338","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}